This directory contains the mdict-cpp parser from https://github.com/dictlab/mdict-cpp,
commit 6661d75d443a2cd24f23f548e4586b677b628346, downloaded on 2026-09-27.
Its BSD-3-Clause license and AUTHORS file are included.

Okular builds this copy by default for desktop and mobile builds.
Set OKULAR_USE_BUNDLED_MDICT=OFF to use a platform mdict-cpp package instead.
The upstream miniz include was replaced with the platform zlib header, and the
upstream TurboBase64 dependency was replaced with a small compatible encoder
in src/turbobase64/turbob64.h. mdict_lookup now catches parser exceptions at
the C API boundary. The mdict-cpp command-line tool is omitted.
